  <main class="shell">
    <header class="masthead">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">LOCAL PARTICLE GNCA · TOP-DOWN PBD</p>
        <h1>Particle Lizard Lab</h1>
        <p class="subtitle">Arrange conserved, always-active particles into a body through local interactions and repair it without gravity or nonlocal forces.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="status-wrap" aria-live="polite">
        <span class="status-dot"></span><span id="status">Loading lizard target…</span>
      </div>
    </header>

    <section class="control-strip" aria-label="Simulation controls">
      <label>
        <span>Controller</span>
        <select id="controller">
          <option value="heuristic">Local bonding heuristic</option>
          <option value="neural">Local particle GNCA</option>
          <option value="random">Random local policy</option>
        </select>
      </label>
      <label>
        <span>Genome</span>
        <select id="genome">
          <option value="fresh">Fresh random weights</option>
          <option value="trained" disabled>Latest evolved checkpoint</option>
        </select>
      </label>
      <label class="seed-field">
        <span>World seed</span>
        <input id="seed" type="number" min="1" step="1" value="42" />
      </label>
      <label class="check ghost-check">
        <input id="ghost" type="checkbox" />
        <span>Show evaluator target</span>
      </label>
      <div class="button-group">
        <button id="play" class="button button-primary" type="button">Pause</button>
        <button id="step" class="button" type="button">Step</button>
        <button id="reset" class="button" type="button">Reset seed</button>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="arena-section">
      <div class="arena-head">
        <div class="legend">
          <span><i class="swatch living"></i>Latent-state cluster</span>
          <span><i class="swatch bond"></i>Local PBD bond</span>
          <span><i class="swatch target"></i>Target overlay</span>
        </div>
        <div class="button-group">
          <button id="damage" class="button button-danger" type="button">Damage body</button>
          <button id="brush" class="button" type="button" aria-pressed="false">Damage brush</button>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="canvas-frame particle-frame">
        <canvas id="arena" width="960" height="640" aria-label="Top-down particle PBD morphogenesis simulation"></canvas>
        <p class="canvas-hint" id="canvas-hint">Click a particle to inspect it</p>
      </div>
      <p class="selection-line" id="selection">No particle selected.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="metrics" aria-label="Live measures">
      <article class="metric"><span>MATCHED MSE</span><strong id="shape">—</strong></article>
      <article class="metric"><span>Q90 ERROR</span><strong id="shape-q90">—</strong></article>
      <article class="metric"><span>SEED CONNECTED</span><strong id="living">0%</strong></article>
      <article class="metric"><span>RECRUITMENT PROXIMITY</span><strong id="recruitment-potential">0%</strong></article>
      <article class="metric"><span>RECOVERY</span><strong id="connectivity">100%</strong></article>
      <article class="metric"><span>CORRECT BOND TOPOLOGY</span><strong id="bond-topology">0%</strong></article>
      <article class="metric"><span>BODY DRIFT</span><strong id="body-drift">0.00</strong></article>
    </section>

    <section class="workbench">
      <article class="panel training-panel">
        <div class="panel-head">
          <div>
            <p class="eyebrow">MIRRORED EVOLUTION STRATEGY</p>
            <h2>Evolve the local rule</h2>
          </div>
          <span id="stage-badge" class="badge">recruitment stage</span>
        </div>
        <p class="panel-copy">
          Fitness finds the exact one-to-one particle-to-target assignment with the lowest centered mean squared error in the target's fixed orientation. Every target site must receive exactly one particle; rotated and reflected matches are not considered. Whole-body drift is still discouraged, and the controller receives none of these evaluator signals.
        </p>
        <p class="note" id="stage-criteria">Recruitment advances after three consecutive generations with at least 90% seed connectivity.</p>
        <div class="training-controls particle-training-controls">
          <label><span>Objective</span><select id="objective">
            <option value="curriculum">Automatic curriculum</option>
            <option value="recruitment">Recruitment only</option>
            <option value="assembly">Lizard only</option>
          </select></label>
          <label><span>Initialization</span><select id="initialization">
            <option value="diffuse">Seed recruitment</option>
            <option value="target">Target maintenance</option>
            <option value="compact">Legacy packed diagnostic</option>
          </select></label>
          <label><span>Particles</span><input id="particle-count" type="number" min="32" max="240" step="8" value="32" /></label>
          <label><span>Lattice spacing · × r</span><input id="lattice-spacing" type="number" min="2" max="8" step="0.25" value="3.5" /></label>
          <label><span>Latent color groups</span><input id="latent-clusters" type="number" min="2" max="12" step="1" value="7" /></label>
          <label><span>Rollout time · seconds</span><input id="rollout-seconds" type="number" min="1" max="30" step="0.5" value="7" /></label>
          <label><span>Integration steps</span><input id="rollout-steps" type="number" min="140" max="840" step="70" value="210" /></label>
          <label><span>Population</span><input id="population" type="number" min="2" max="48" step="2" value="8" /></label>
          <label><span>Workers</span><input id="workers" type="number" min="1" max="12" step="1" value="${Math.max(1,Math.min(8,navigator.hardwareConcurrency??8))}" /></label>
          <label><span>Noise σ</span><input id="sigma" type="number" min="0.005" max="0.5" step="0.005" value="0.03" /></label>
          <label><span>Learning rate</span><input id="learning-rate" type="number" min="0.001" max="0.1" step="0.001" value="0.008" /></label>
        </div>
        <div class="training-stats" aria-live="polite">
          <div><span>GENERATION</span><strong id="training-generation">—</strong></div>
          <div><span>BEST FITNESS</span><strong id="training-best">—</strong></div>
          <div><span>MEAN FITNESS</span><strong id="training-mean">—</strong></div>
        </div>
        <div class="training-visuals">
          <div class="chart-wrap">
            <svg id="loss-chart" role="img" aria-label="Particle policy fitness by generation" viewBox="0 0 640 180">
              <line class="chart-axis" x1="42" y1="10" x2="42" y2="150"></line>
              <line class="chart-axis" x1="42" y1="150" x2="630" y2="150"></line>
              <text x="5" y="18">1.0</text><text x="42" y="173">generation</text>
              <path id="mean-path" class="mean-path" d=""></path>
              <path id="best-path" class="best-path" d=""></path>
            </svg>
            <div class="chart-empty" id="chart-empty">Fitness appears after the first generation.</div>
          </div>
          <div class="generation-preview-wrap">
            <p>GENERATION BEST · FINAL STATE</p>
            <canvas id="generation-preview" width="300" height="180" aria-label="Final particle shape of the generation's best candidate"></canvas>
            <div id="preview-empty">Preview appears after the first generation.</div>
            <p class="note" id="preview-metrics">No generation metrics yet.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="panel-actions">
          <button id="train" class="button button-primary" type="button">Start evolving</button>
          <button id="advance-stage" class="button" type="button">Advance stage</button>
          <button id="use-trained" class="button" type="button" disabled>Use latest genome</button>
          <button id="reset-genome" class="button button-danger" type="button">Reset genome</button>
          <button id="export" class="button" type="button" disabled>Export genome</button>
          <label class="button file-button">Import genome<input id="import" type="file" accept="application/json" /></label>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="panel method-panel">
        <div class="panel-head">
          <div><p class="eyebrow">LOCALITY CONTRACT</p><h2>What a particle knows</h2></div>
          <span class="badge">${J.toLocaleString()} parameters</span>
        </div>
        <dl class="spec-list">
          <div><dt>Perception</dt><dd>every particle within ${c.sightRadius} units</dd></div>
          <div><dt>Observed</dt><dd>relative pose, velocity, bonds, oscillator, latent state</dd></div>
          <div><dt>Actions</dt><dd>local self-force, contact glue/release, bonded contraction, latent update</dd></div>
          <div><dt>Physics</dt><dd id="method-physics">30 Hz training · 7s · ${c.pbdIterations} PBD passes</dd></div>
          <div><dt>Forbidden to policy</dt><dd>target offsets, absolute position, COM, remote particles</dd></div>
          <div><dt>Matter</dt><dd id="method-matter">${c.particleCount} particles always conserved</dd></div>
        </dl>
        <p class="note">The target and center-of-mass drift are trainer/display signals only. They never add observations, forces, or a hidden global correction.</p>
      </article>
    </section>
  </main>
